+## v0.3.58 — one-pass caller register snapshot
+
+- Extend the existing shared logical-entry hook to snapshot RCX, RDX, and the raw [RDX+0x10] slot together for each seeded external caller. The snapshot is retained across recursive calls and correlated to the exact root descriptor.
+- This reuses one hook across the 52 static caller candidates; it does not install 52 breakpoints. The snapshot is taken at shared callee entry immediately after the call, before the hooked function body proceeds.
+- The register snapshot establishes values at that entry point; it does not by itself identify the slot's semantic type or prove a named C++ class.
 
 ## v0.3.57 — logical-entry dispatch capture
 
